2Sam 8:5 compare 1Chr 18:5 , even ׳א נַהֲרַיִם Psa 60:2 (title); (note that Assyrian never gives name Aramu to people west of Euphrates, but Chatti instead, with other particular names, COT Gen 10:22 , also Dl l.c .); on 2Sam 8:12-13 , 1Chr 18:11 see אֱדוֺם . b. less often clearly of land , Aram Num 23:7 ; 2Sam 15:8 2Chr 20:2 (read however here אדום Thes Add and others), א ׳שְׂדֵה Hosea 12:13 ; also of particular divisions of the territory ׳א נַהֲרַיִם 'Mesopotamia,' i.e. probably land between Euphrates & Chaboras, so Di after Kiep, Gen 24:10 ; Deut 23:5 ; Judg 3:8 (compare Psa 60:2 above); compare א ׳מַּדַּן Paddan-Aram Gen 25:20 ; 31:18 ; 33:18 ; 35:9 , 26 ; 46:15 , א ׳מַּדֶּ֫נָה 28:2 , 5 , 6 , 7 see פדן ; ׳א דַּמֶּשֶׂק 2Sam 8:6 compare 1Chr 18:6 . c. often indeterminate, especially in א ׳מֶלֶךְ etc., perhaps primarily land but often including people: so Judg 2:11 ; 10:6 ( א ׳אֱלֹהֵי ) 1Kin 10:29 2Chr 1:17 + (41 t. Kings & Chronicles) Isa 7:1 . &#8212; (compare especially Nö Sehenkel BL, ZMG 1871, 113; Hermes see 3, 443 f. Dl Pa 257 .)","rootNote":"from the same as 759 ; the highland;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 17","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 17","1Chr 2 23","1Chr 7 34","1Chr 18 5","1Chr 18 5","1Chr 18 6","1Chr 18 6","1Chr 19 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":133,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/אֲרָ֑ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ֠/אֲרָם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/אֲרָֽם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרַ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 